sequenceDiagram
  participant S as Orders + DB
  participant R as Relay
  participant K as Broker
  participant C as Shipping
  S->>S: 1 tx: order + outbox row
  R->>S: claim rows (SKIP LOCKED)
  R->>K: publish, key = order id
  K-->>R: ack
  R->>S: mark rows sent
  K->>C: deliver, at least once
  C->>C: 1 tx: inbox row + change
